<article class="env-lemma" id="09H8">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/09H8">Lemma <span data-tag="09H8">9.12.9</span>.</a> In Situation <a href="/tag/09H6" data-tag="09H6">9.12.7</a> we have $|\mathop{\mathrm{Mor}}\nolimits _ F(K, \overline{F})| = \prod _{i = 1}^ n \deg _ s(P_ i)$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This follows immediately from Lemma <a href="/tag/09H7" data-tag="09H7">9.12.8</a>. Observe that a key ingredient we are tacitly using here is the well-definedness of the separable degree of an irreducible polynomial which was observed just prior to Definition <a href="/tag/09H5" data-tag="09H5">9.12.6</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>